          "material_id": "A4-M3",
          "material_type": "prompt_set",
          "activity_id": "A4",
          "title": "Explain the Chain of Effects",
          "body_format": "markdown",
          "body": "1. What changes in the residuals?\n2. Which regression assumption is affected?\n3. How can standard errors be influenced?\n4. Why might confidence intervals become less reliable?\n5. How could this affect a research conclusion?"
        },
