          "title": "Detection and Remedy Options",
          "body_format": "markdown",
          "body": "## Detection\n\n- Residual plots provide visual evidence.\n- The Breusch–Pagan test provides a formal statistical check.\n\n## Remedies\n\n- Robust standard errors improve inference when variance is not constant.\n- Logarithmic transformations may reduce variability differences.\n- Improved model specification may address omitted influences.\n\nEvaluation criteria:\n1. Suitability for available evidence.\n2. Support for reliable inference.\n3. Practical simplicity."
